{"id":10000064,"name":"云堇","enName":"Yun Jin","title":"红毹婵娟","element":"岩","region":"璃月","rarity":4,"weapon":"长柄武器","birthday":"5月21日","constellation":"虹章座","description":"集剧作与演唱能力于一身的璃月戏曲名角。风格自成一派，雅致柔美，恰如其人。","affiliation":"云翰社","cv":{"chinese":"贺文潇&杨扬","japanese":"小岩井小鸟&杨扬","english":"朱蒂·艾丽丝·李&杨扬","korean":"史文英&杨扬"},"avatarImg":"assets/characters/10000064-avatar.webp","splashArt":"assets/characters/10000064-art.webp","hasLocalPack":false,"voicePackageUrl":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/simon3000/genshin-voice/resolve/main/speaker-archives/Chinese/501-plus/Yun_Jin.zip","voicePackageEn":"Yun_Jin","quoteCount":69,"friendLines":[{"title":"初次见面…","desc":"有道是闻名不如见面，今天终于有缘与你相会，实属荣幸。我姓云，单名一个堇字，不才正是云翰社当家主事的人。我们戏社最近挂靠在和裕茶馆，日后还请多多赏光，常来听戏。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_draw_appear","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/71/hpdmx0eg4j294w1ge01x3bj6gj24bkx.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·敏感话题","desc":"这两天总觉得身上腰封有点紧，难道…我胖了？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_character_idle_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e7/f1pk9081x3hv7rk4lsoyqaojli0dfjk.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·闲适","desc":"不勒头，不画脸，今天乐得清闲。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_character_idle_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c2/6s1y5bi8ltdy4tgvrgoql5l7c0i2k6g.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·清唱","desc":"云婵娟来花婵娟，风流尽在山水间。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_character_idle_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/98/b1ncc150l3lcbjhmiprwrdqyljf71wl.mp3"},{"title":"打雷的时候…","desc":"…嘶，你听、听见打雷没有？吓我一跳。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_weather_thunder_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/33/l9z2kf848jf5n77tgdikwo9l93hqyxn.mp3"},{"title":"下雪的时候…","desc":"喂呀，冻煞我了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_weather_snowy_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/36/8ib8i2v8gj9zp5ay4igaifye8lcpo7m.mp3"},{"title":"阳光很好…","desc":"暖阳和煦，真是好风光呀。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_weather_sunny_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5a/8z4bbs5272dxs8emo26uszbh46uc4uk.mp3"},{"title":"早上好…","desc":"早，清晨露水正好煎茶，喝完这杯茶再出发吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_dialog_greetingMorning","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/7b/l5ukk6dmv114jr6euwv06yq9y7i5ufw.mp3"},{"title":"中午好…","desc":"午饭吃完之后，想睡一觉…哈…你不困吗？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_dialog_greetingNoon","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f0/kmexm915r9stzpzoco8pab9045a5gwp.mp3"},{"title":"晚上好…","desc":"一道去听听晚场说书吧，刘苏先生讲《裁雨声》是一绝。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_dialog_greetingNight","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/11/5woldwap97bfmd7frhxbaga1o84ycu5.mp3"},{"title":"晚安…","desc":"夜里寒气重，早点歇息，晚安。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_dialog_greetingNight2","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/ca/jwmzuqw2dbrnuvbpmlm6534tcmd6tzs.mp3"},{"title":"关于云堇自己·开蒙","desc":"我开蒙早，刚记事的时候父亲就在教我读书了。可惜，他的本事要是有十分，我恐怕只学到了三分。写戏是够用了，但要和饱学之士相比，还差得太远。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_dialog_idle","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/1e/rds45rjtvj1cseechhlkcx2ungp40l8.mp3"},{"title":"关于云堇自己·坐科","desc":"我母亲早年是璃月港内大有名气的角儿，我学的戏都是她教的。你是不知道她有多严厉，一想起以前学戏的经历…不不不，我还是别想了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_dialog_idle2","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/60/7fzrrls4dph9c9t0mt8o40yo5kjo1k3.mp3"},{"title":"关于我们·搭班","desc":"最近有几场大戏，正好缺一位擅长舞剑的演员，我觉得你各方面都挺适合。怎么样，有兴趣搭班吗？休息时，还能一起品茶。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_dialog_close","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/2a/1q76x7whf60m6j588qmyirtlwk1vsh6.mp3"},{"title":"关于我们·摇滚","desc":"欸，你还听摇滚？正好正好，下回我想出去听演唱会的时候，就找你一块去。回来的时候，我就说是拜访你去了，这下戏社里的老人肯定找不到借口唠叨我。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_dialog_close1","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b7/moruvsrnevwtape4e4db2wqvagw9hng.mp3"},{"title":"关于「神之眼」…","desc":"这神之眼嘛…说不定岩王爷也喜欢听戏呢？大概他老人家听得开心，就把神之眼送给我了，哈哈。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_dialog_pendant","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d9/d10dcyc55mwp2nddftgk71ne5apzvys.mp3"},{"title":"有什么想要分享·饮品","desc":"我最喜欢尝试各种各样的饮品。老一辈发明的那些讲究茶饮，什么松间露呀梅上雪的，都让我试了个遍。现在正愁没有新饮品可以喝呢，欸，你有什么推荐吗？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_dialog_share_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/12/ez55ygmp2gjmbi5mlgqq3nl2icouuu4.mp3"},{"title":"有什么想要分享·心愿","desc":"我偶尔也想脱下戏服，远游海外，去更大的世界看看。为了实现这个心愿，得更加努力才行。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_dialog_share_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/6e/7oe3yrk6u48agy7e3gwudd7q6xdfm6c.mp3"},{"title":"感兴趣的见闻…","desc":"每天天刚破晓就能听见莺雀鸣啭，心情总能变得很好。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_pref_gift_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/1a/4g0adkjga8kixd2d27ybpfgl8bnwwpd.mp3"},{"title":"关于辛焱…","desc":"戏社里那几个老人天天念叨，说是听多了摇滚会被带坏，不让我去听辛焱的演唱会。嘴上说着为我好，哼，我看他们只是接受不了新事物而已。我才不会听他们的，辛焱的演唱会我每周都要去，就是这样。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_teammate_xinyan_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/8e/snyvejrppguhhj3hnuvov8sha4hor0r.mp3"},{"title":"关于胡桃…","desc":"胡桃她呀，表情丰富，脑筋还转得快，哪怕只是聊些家常都能「妙语连珠」。真让人羡慕。和这样的朋友在一起，无论做什么事情都很有趣。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_teammate_hutao_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/40/rs1whswf98zcgqw5u6mbr604yxkg90w.mp3"},{"title":"关于钟离…","desc":"我们这行的规矩代代相传，讲究多得很。有些事我只知其然，却不知其所以然。但钟离先生讲起这些竟能如数家珍，有这样懂行的观众，谁不开心呢？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_teammate_zhongli_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/03/7t1a3hzkrsrfo2o9xwikouwadq1j2tj.mp3"},{"title":"关于凝光…","desc":"天权星出手阔绰，没少资助我们戏社。领了她的情，自然也要回报给她最好的演出。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_teammate_ningguang_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d3/sekpxv87b2z2pwpayskrl6dkaucc91x.mp3"},{"title":"关于行秋…","desc":"原来你也认识行秋。哈哈，他聪明得很，鬼主意那么多，怕是一不留神就会捉弄你，可得留个心眼啊。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_teammate_xingqiu_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b9/s64yifkvvvfyfb4gnwf2868paxqqll5.mp3"},{"title":"关于申鹤…","desc":"《神女劈观》的剧本我早就念得烂熟，但直到今天我才知道「神女」原来真有其人，世上缘分果然奇妙。惟愿她往后都有好友相伴，不再孤寂。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_teammate_shenhe_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/28/7robek1xz9nrbzcawobp3l9zia62uzi.mp3"},{"title":"关于刻晴…","desc":"我倒没见过玉衡星来听戏。印象里，路边偶遇这位时，她也总是一副行色匆匆的样子。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_teammate_keqing_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/31/rg3q0bct7kbig8zbdvdbvtwt3ndwgji.mp3"},{"title":"关于枫原万叶…","desc":"爱听戏的外国人士也有不少，这位枫原万叶就是其中之一。不论台上演的是文场还是武场，他总是安安静静地听，是个规矩的好观众。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_teammate_kazuha_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f1/mxsfjdxr4rw3wd47larbhbvo37vdopn.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解云堇·其一","desc":"我们戏社现在常唱的几出戏，有不少是我当家之后新写出来的。写也是我，唱也是我，一人多职，大概是因为这一点，我在璃月港有了些名气。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_friendship_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/ab/oa2t4k5daxu52r1pf9b2l6ayjsjtk5b.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解云堇·其二","desc":"按照传统，伶人登台之前要勒头、画脸、穿行头，还有其他一些零碎的准备工作。虽然这样「全副武装」之后扮相会更好看，但也累人。所以我能清唱时就清唱，非得彩唱的话，我往往会挑轻便点的行头。\n幸好和我们戏社长期合作的和裕茶馆管得宽松，要不然我真是要累惨了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_friendship_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9f/e337vn208x66jtrtknn1p5pg14tbuem.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解云堇·其三","desc":"当初我刚登台唱戏，凭着观众抬爱，不免有些心高气傲。戏本不喜欢就不唱，戏台子小了也不唱，观众少了还是不唱。现在想来，那时候可真是…太傲慢了…以后万万不能这样。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_friendship_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/67/nj54u7mpaapp8orcai2jgsqrjy5alop.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解云堇·其四","desc":"回想起来，云翰社传到我手上也有段时间了。原本我只懂得写戏、唱戏，从来没把心思放在经营交际上。做了戏社的当家之后，才不得不在这些事上多长点心眼，因此体味到不少人情冷暖…\n这时候我才真知道，人生如戏，戏如人生啊。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_friendship_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/69/qzq3dthzx17pkd32uooyry9icu9x7v1.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解云堇·其五","desc":"璃月多传说，大都是些魔神、仙人故事，所以璃月戏里最多的就是神仙戏。最近新演的《神女劈观》就属此类。虽然老戏迷们最爱听的就是这类故事，但如今是「人」的时代，我想多写些属于人类的故事，把天下人心唱给大家听。\n这些想法，过去我不曾向人提起。多谢你能耐心听我说这些。有一知音，我很幸运。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_friendship_05","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a0/k0gj1mjqnchokpn06g8y3spj9u3n5hq.mp3"},{"title":"云堇的爱好…","desc":"爱好？当然是戏了。我是打定主意要唱一辈子的。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_pref_hobby","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/ff/h2s8itt2r7i10vtb925nm2eq6nbs3el.mp3"},{"title":"云堇的烦恼…","desc":"烦恼…唉，为了保持体型，我平时一口都不能多吃。人生在世，连美食都不能奢求，真是遗憾哪。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_dialog_annoyed","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c2/nh3bhm3kau9zzgdon5fzudl8q9bbsys.mp3"},{"title":"喜欢的食物…","desc":"天枢肉、水煮黑背鲈、干锅腊肉…我都想吃。可惜平时基本吃不了，那个…我就随便问一问，你…会做这几道菜吗？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_pref_foodLike","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/27/dn9jdfai0020lt5eqilvmtezy96maba.mp3"},{"title":"讨厌的食物…","desc":"天天都是清炒虾仁，天天都是…再怎么做都还是那个味道，我是真的吃腻了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_pref_foodDislike","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/52/tt33h3m5pjgyptabiimh6vufijr7tq7.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其一","desc":"美食，总会让人倍感幸福…可惜只能点到为止，不能再多吃了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_spice_pref_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/db/g4ihfumdhpk1e1veghlskjyvjn3deu7.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其二","desc":"看着就很丰盛！稍等，我去找些饮品来，配着饭菜一起享用吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_spice_normal_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/ef/eqoa4pd3ql53moeyho5gscxdrm6bfir.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其三","desc":"不好意思…这道菜肴呀，我是吃不了多少的。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_spice_dislike_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/8c/cgz4m6o51cp51ekm99cdvh97ds80p9o.mp3"},{"title":"生日…","desc":"原来今天是你的生日吗？我没有置办宴席的本事，只能为你唱一曲了。不过，这一曲只为你一个人唱，要听什么？你来定。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_pref_birthday_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/dd/qmvrec9347p07l7ezjz588vedvsrx6x.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·起","desc":"俗语说：「业精于勤而荒于嬉。」","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_starUp_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/dc/mek6maeg3rqc5th0zrcuaqbermdhzbe.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·承","desc":"勤学苦练至今，总算是有了些成果。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_starUp_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c2/fz4ry562r82p5zmjukypxfeqire4b13.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·转","desc":"学枪一事，原先是为了台上舞枪好看，后来是为了掌握傍身武技。如今这两个目标都已达到。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_starUp_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b4/9oms0uo7u5sv03ae0xdstsk5z47zl2n.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·合","desc":"枪术千变万化，奥妙无比，让我庆幸的是，练枪时一直有你相伴。我已经领悟到其中旨要。往后切磋时，你可得小心了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_starUp_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/01/7m1nvj3lq6cbs9kokkuzfhi3cjny3bw.mp3"}],"actionLines":[{"title":"元素战技·其一","desc":"着！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_battle_skill1_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/99/fw9tk9j9kr213pexptjt3g4ohrjzx5o.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其二","desc":"崩！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_battle_skill1_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/23/tobtzxftxb2u1yhoid57vuv2wef6osa.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其三","desc":"旗来！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_battle_skill1_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/34/ejty7heqi4aj22y7luxv9l91lraa3b8.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其四","desc":"飞云旗！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_battle_skill1_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/0f/n2tf4njb85ijgecrsncu3k77nsudi1y.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其五","desc":"看枪！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_battle_skill1_05","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a2/dy688v3ysz2avwwkyuxrc6x4atu4n2s.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其一","desc":"听我号令！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_battle_skill3_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d7/onguchvcgrhz2fwcvla3t5nlid9xlxu.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其二","desc":"勠力同心！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_battle_skill3_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/6d/qn29gcd8i6a8dkcgtzkbg1gdwa5isec.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其三","desc":"一鼓作气！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_battle_skill3_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/34/js2lcedacd63n1boj708bn2jdo5j1xt.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其一","desc":"我来瞧瞧。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_chest_open_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/50/2qvhoklcocs9a9bqwqzzukuhvolj816.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其二","desc":"是旅行中用得上的物资吗？","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_chest_open_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/40/jate44kapt7m0053e1nwosd8fbltdxg.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其三","desc":"别客气，你收着就行。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_chest_open_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/8c/1lnjqqtjos2wfged99i6qfj560dqaw6.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其一","desc":"别把裙子弄坏了…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_life_less30_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a6/hlvdm3rtizj59h7ggoecxix0rspx4gq.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其二","desc":"得重整旗鼓才行。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_life_less30_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/4f/eymp21dotzhh86nbew23wuhft9m7pwt.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其三","desc":"哼，好戏在后面。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_life_less30_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c3/cezvmocctlla0e9axn3ua8k5j8fkgkq.mp3"},{"title":"同伴生命值低·其一","desc":"你先下场。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_life_less30_teammate_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a2/64tuzzzc186cch0anguotqijh41y04y.mp3"},{"title":"同伴生命值低·其二","desc":"我来救场。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_life_less30_teammate_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5f/f0d2nyl6y6ozqb9ohso3bi733ybla7v.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其一","desc":"曲终…人散…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_life_die_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/0b/asp23urkgy17vmc75gxn1ucd4mq3051.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其二","desc":"罢了…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_life_die_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d5/724fp15q8uim7kl6smlqfd9pz3qq4n7.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其三","desc":"没办法…唱下去了…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_life_die_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/ea/4wnybbfca53hdzrpqx46ki79p44jw84.mp3"},{"title":"普通受击·其一","desc":"要沉住气…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_battle_hit_L_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b6/lxunpicfhcc1n1z00us1wv634iskqkm.mp3"},{"title":"重受击·其一","desc":"有点狼狈…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_battle_hit_H_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/8e/5p78b5th9yrybq61l437m8qcmgucptp.mp3"},{"title":"重受击·其二","desc":"下手好重…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_yunjin/vo_yunjin_battle_hit_H_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/4c/r5x2cr51pstcg3sz3l9ovhf4ckj8vh0.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其一","desc":"走——了——","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_yunjin_teamJoin_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/61/4t9cg7265kiunovsk80m28qzcxjx0kl.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其二","desc":"今天该唱哪出呢？","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_yunjin_teamJoin_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5d/s0orlsks7bk0250ajcx68yiy3jvn2nn.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其三","desc":"你叫我，我当然要来了。","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_yunjin_teamJoin_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/7b/omuqi6q8d10xtxtae9h21et5s076oux.mp3"}],"cardArt":"assets/characters/10000064-card.webp","fullArt":"assets/characters/10000064-full.webp","fullArtWidth":702,"fullArtHeight":818}